# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Gallery

The runnable showcase: where to see this project's output rendered rather than described, how to run
it, and what it is and is not evidence of.

A gallery is the fastest way to answer "what does this actually look like", and the easiest thing in
a project to let rot — because nothing breaks when it does. A gallery that no longer builds is
discovered by the person who most needed it.

Owned by whoever owns the components it renders.

